.fallow/

# Build artifacts generated on demand (dev/build/typecheck/test all run
# `npm run prepare:release-notes` first).
#
# Depth-agnostic on purpose (MAR-2706). Git cannot follow an ignored file
# through the move to `apps/convergence/`, so a checkout that ran a gate before
# the move keeps its generated file at the old root path. Anchored at the new
# path alone, that leftover stops being ignored the moment the move lands and
# surfaces as `?? src/` — apparent legacy source in a tree that has none. One
# line covers both eras.
**/src/shared/generated/

.env
.env.*
*.local

# Working-relationship artifacts (local only)
FABLE.md
HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF-*.md

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Debug logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
